WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.585 --> 00:00:05.005
♪ Everybody wants the power ♪

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:09.218
You know we were supposed to

00:00:09.218 --> 00:00:10.510
changes things, weren’t we?

00:00:12.471 --> 00:00:14.097
I wanted to make a difference.

00:00:16.058 --> 00:00:18.560
I need to have a say in
the future of this place.

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:21.271
I want to build
something that matters,

00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:22.272
I want to win.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:23.815
It isn’t real.

00:00:24.066 --> 00:00:25.567
It’s all smoke and mirrors.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:27.402
You need a miracle.

00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:30.072
I am offering you a lifeline.

00:00:30.364 --> 00:00:32.491
5, 4, 3...

00:00:32.491 --> 00:00:34.785
♪♪

00:00:34.785 --> 00:00:36.703
Honestly, let all the
secrets come out,

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:38.622
they did not protect me.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:40.749
They didn’t protect you,

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:41.583
but I did.

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:45.295
It’s time to smash and shatter.

00:00:45.963 --> 00:00:47.089
Let’s burn it all down.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:48.298
Woo!

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:50.467
I hope it was all worth it. 

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:52.219
♪♪

